# Example target list for OmniPing.
# Import: Add & scan → List or file → Load from file…, or paste these lines.
# Each line: an address or name, then an optional alias. With commas you can
# add a group too: address, alias, group
# MultiPing .lst and .mpl files can be loaded directly.
192.168.1.1, Router, Home
192.168.1.10, NAS, Home
1.1.1.1, Cloudflare DNS, Internet
8.8.8.8, Google DNS, Internet
9.9.9.9, Quad9 DNS, Internet
example.com, Example website, Internet
